<title>RUSSIA: Russia Finance Minister to Germany for debt talks.</title>
<headline>Russia Finance Minister to Germany for debt talks.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Finance Minister Alexander Livshits will visit Germany on February 5 to discuss restructuring Russian debt owed to the German government, Itar-Tass news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>Livshits plans to meet his German counterpart Theo Waigel, it said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
